msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Haruka. Is... something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"What do you mean, \"is something wrong\"!?\r\n"
"How could you abandon Taichi like that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "...Sorry. Something came up."
msgstr "Mi dispiace, è saltato fuori un imprevisto."

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Something more important than one of your kids collapsed on\r\n"
"the beach!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Well, uh..."
msgstr "Beh, ehm..."

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Ugh! You're the worst, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Uncle Rikiya brought him inside while you were gone. Oh, and\r\n"
"the doctor wants to talk to you, so don't go wandering off\r\n"
"again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

